{"4126040":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"伊莫","steam_appid":4126040,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<h1>Steam区服列表<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/efd95b967b83f960a674d7f9367bddaf.avif?t=1789651507\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras_big\/efd95b967b83f960a674d7f9367bddaf.webp?t=1789651507 width=1560 height=439 \/><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>关于游戏<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/02cc585d6729171aad27a49ebd4b21f4.poster.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/02cc585d6729171aad27a49ebd4b21f4.webm?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/02cc585d6729171aad27a49ebd4b21f4.mp4?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>《伊莫》是一款多人在线大世界捉宠RPG。你将在广袤的艾德尔大陆上邂逅各种神奇生物——伊莫。和他们联结合体，还能以全新的视角和能力感受这个世界的美好。你也可以来到浮空天际的近未来都市，邂逅其他冒险家，交流旅途心得或是感受竞技的魅力。快带上你的伊莫，开启一场超越想象的大世界冒险之旅吧！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/2bf9813aa7ed7e8eaa213cbb68b9c704.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1560 height=130 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/432d267f3163b10da9f343f37906e678.poster.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/432d267f3163b10da9f343f37906e678.webm?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/432d267f3163b10da9f343f37906e678.mp4?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在冒险的旅途中，你将与伊莫联结合体，并利用伊莫的各种能力：完成世界上的谜题，赢得每场战斗的胜利，解决遇到的一切问题！不再局限于人类的速度、视野和能力，亲自体验理性与野性共存的蓬勃。与伊莫“联结”合体，用全新的视角感受世界！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/3f08853210f864a14abd4b2c68ba541c.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1560 height=130 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/c04b5d6f734a3afb1b2b774e0f9bc863.poster.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/c04b5d6f734a3afb1b2b774e0f9bc863.webm?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/c04b5d6f734a3afb1b2b774e0f9bc863.mp4?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每只伊莫都会因区域、天气、养成方式和成长线的不同，进化出多样分支形态。从沙滩形态到潮湿形态，从晒日光浴的海湾红，到分支进化为女巫草或“家里蹲”埋埋，生态千差万别。丰富的形态图鉴等待你捕捉收集、培养与研究，构筑独属于你的莫百科！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/c15a9e3d11608f54b6d30e0282f301de.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1560 height=130 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/ca1ddeabd0d85243bc3543f03fa6a62b.poster.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/ca1ddeabd0d85243bc3543f03fa6a62b.webm?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/ca1ddeabd0d85243bc3543f03fa6a62b.mp4?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >或是蓬松的绒毛，或是坚硬的铠甲……逼真的材质、丰富的动作表现，让你穿透屏幕，抚摸生命的灵动。羞羞獭抱铲猛冲、焚火狼静坐火旁、花芽蟹明明强壮却胆小。不经意间展现的小动作和反差正是他们迷人又可爱的地方！当它们敲敲屏幕，那是向你撒娇的信号！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/7482a99d26c4f5647afec7efa9bc588e.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1560 height=130 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/15ebd412810e55832ec553d9a8d35815.poster.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/15ebd412810e55832ec553d9a8d35815.webm?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/15ebd412810e55832ec553d9a8d35815.mp4?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各种神奇生物——伊莫，在艾德尔大陆上共生共舞，每一个种族都各自延续着独特的种族生态与群落故事。每一个角落，都是自然精妙的构思；每一道声音，都记录着生命的回响。更多新的故事会在挥爪一刻与大家邂逅，让每次冒险都更具世界厚度！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/c256c14cc543a3838cf1da37249c6e65.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1560 height=130 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/61adf645d31e69cd050b3272115db8ee.poster.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/61adf645d31e69cd050b3272115db8ee.webm?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/61adf645d31e69cd050b3272115db8ee.mp4?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >体验真正的即时制自由捉宠战斗的爽快！背袭、连续投掷、出其不意...当捕捉的方式不再单一，每一次丢出谜立方的瞬间都充满了惊喜；全新“抢蛋大作战”加入偷蛋玩法，和朋友一起获得稀有宠物，与其他玩家争夺稀有伊莫蛋，在策略、博弈与运气间享受紧张爽快的对抗！<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/ae60eab290551b553a9182fcd9ea0786.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1560 height=130 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/b650d0f3615772433dbf1ef0d56d3d95.poster.avif?t=1789651507\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/b650d0f3615772433dbf1ef0d56d3d95.webm?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4126040\/extras\/b650d0f3615772433dbf1ef0d56d3d95.mp4?t=1789651507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位冒险者都有一辆可停驻大世界营地的房车，与其他玩家相遇、交流。当回到家园，可与伊莫一同种植、建造与自由布置空间。旋转木马磨坊、摩天轮纺车等装置将生产与游玩融合，与好友协力和伊莫助力，让家园成为轻松、有趣、充满互动的温暖乐园！<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_par